4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x6FXj7UN8r0Q7kNvwHwbYup&_nc_oc=Adq471VMe2ZHF1fav6cRIobWSn3qsbB4pRFc9evZVM835zJjp4NqlarCQHiOpZgO7cE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL0Rz37pGWE8-3rFLOISu-e6DxLcAkro_f1bUAJ2O2Glg&oe=6AA15954"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FWhBVfVkhKgQ7kNvwGAwCMx&_nc_oc=AdrsGQid5vkXdj0EQEQ7AqWK1ty2Pm263JKc6xkITz4JA2GWl3wqZ3tDXZYnNKtKqww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL2ic7uvTqW46UV1va_x6gxt1us0HXaZVN_z9wAT_X9SA&oe=6AA15E32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rnatS7qNQfMQ7kNvwGTg-z0&_nc_oc=Ado5irnFka5t5ayzYmWfBIzNavLaDnUPMK0UFRCTlKIKqA0ond-bRZxZlgNfUcz6XJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVuMxxpTeMYDFpr4m3FuPXxl365i-up5sfUjin9QC1ig&oe=6AA16BD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p